# Leave empty to fetch the public Frankfurter USD/EGP reference rate directly.
# The default works in the browser on GitHub Pages; no key or Azure resource.
# Optional: set a separately hosted Function origin with CORS configured.
# To use the existing local Vite /api proxy, set http://localhost:5173 here.
# VITE_* values are public in the built bundle; never put a secret here.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
